1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Most people think saving money means

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,640
giving up everything they enjoy.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,040
It does not.

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,980
It starts with knowing where your money goes.

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:09,980
For one month,

6
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,140
write down every rupee you spend:

7
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,400
rent, groceries, the bus fare,

8
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,800
the late-night snack.

9
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:24,340
At the end of the month, sort

10
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:37,540
it into three

11
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:41,060
groups: needs, wants and savings.

12
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,000
You will be surprised how much slips

13
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,960
away on small things nobody remembers

14
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,340
buying. Next, pay yourself first.

15
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,600
On payday, move a fixed amount into

16
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,820
a separate savings account before you

17
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,740
spend anything else.

18
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:56,960
Even five percent of your salary adds up.

19
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,900
Then build an emergency fund that

20
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,980
covers three months of expenses,

21
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:02,620
so a broken phone or a hospital

22
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,260
bill does not push you into debt.

23
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,580
Cook at home a few more nights

24
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,480
each week, cancel the subscriptions

25
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,000
you forgot about,

26
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,960
and compare prices before every big purchase.

27
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:15,140
Small habits, repeated every day,

28
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:16,940
turn into real security.

29
00:01:16,940 --> 00:01:17,760
Start this month,

30
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,340
and in a year you will not

31
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,881
recognise your bank balance.
